Add_Dynamic_Module Graphics Appeal_SDL2_Legacy_OpenGL_Graphics
Add_Dynamic_Module Input Appeal_SDL2_Input
Graphics Add_Window Input_Check "SDL2 Input installation check" 320 240
Input Add_Control_Set Install_Check
Input Set_Control_Set Install_Check
Input Bind_Key Jump Space
Input Bind_Mouse Select Left
Input Update Install_Check
Print "UNBOUND"
Print (Input Down Missing)
Print (Input Pressed Missing)
Print (Input Released Missing)
Print (Input Axis Missing)
Print "NO_CONTROLLER"
Print (Input Controller_Down 999 A)
Print (Input Controller_Axis 999 Left_Stick_X)
Graphics Render
Graphics Update
Input Update Install_Check
Input Unbind Jump
Input Unbind Select
Graphics Close_All
Print "INPUT_INSTALL_PASSED"
Done
